Changes in v5:
- Collect tested-by credits from Jagan, Vasily
Changes in v4:
- Rebase some device trees.
Changes in v3,1:
- Squash all enablement patches altogether.
- Change supply name to match DT binding & driver change.
Changes for v3:
- Enable all pipeline components
Changes for v2:
- none

